#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5plus-overview.rst:11
#: 3251f62ce3904b3da4023b74d0511720 627f4affa89b45d1b11d57716a039f3c
#: a65d1ed1a1484b5e84654cef60d11dce b1f560f22c35432c99a24c96560321be
#: c040da34a2df45a881b710ddafaf8744 eabd42c99df84b378507288facd7c354
msgid ""
"The CUAV v5 Plus is an advanced STM32F765 autopilot designed and made by "
"CUAV. It is a variant of the CUAV V5, updated to use Pixhawk standard "
"pinouts. The modular design allows the users to customize their own carrier "
"board. The Carrier Board design reference is `here "
"<https://github.com/cuav/hardware/tree/master/V5_Autopilot/V5%2B/V5%2BBASE>`__"
msgstr ""
"CUAV v5 Plus 是由 CUAV 设计制造的基于 STM32F765 的先进飞控。它是 CUAV V5 的变体，升级采用 Pixhawk "
"标准引脚定义。模块化设计允许用户自定义底板。底板设计参考见 `这里 "
"<https://github.com/cuav/hardware/tree/master/V5_Autopilot/V5%2B/V5%2BBASE>`__"

